## DispatcherHeader（分发器公共头）

```zig
/// NT 可等待对象的公共头部
pub const DispatcherHeader = extern struct {
    type:           u8,
    _reserved:      u8,
    _reserved2:     u8,
    _reserved3:     u8,
    signal_state:   i32,
    wait_list_head: ListEntry,
};
```

